WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Step 1: Open Ordering → Order history. Filter by dates, supplier or order reference and choose View order.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Step 2: To add a missed order, choose Record past order, enter its original date and use the supplier/category cards to add items.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Step 3: Review quantities and historical prices, then choose Save to history. This records the order without emailing the supplier.

4
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Step 4: To remove an incorrect order, open its details, select Delete order and confirm.
